.TH EMUSPLASH 6 "November 2026" "EmuSPLASH 1.0.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
emusplash \- EmuSPLASH, a frontend for browsing and launching games
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B emusplash
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
EmuSPLASH is a frontend for browsing and launching games from your multi-platform collection.
Its settings, game lists and media are kept in ~/EmuSPLASH.
.PP
Run
.B emusplash \-\-help
for the options.
